            {
              "parts": [
                {
                  "text": "I need to determine Madrid's UTC offset on October 12, 2026.\n\nOctober 12, 2026: Spain observes CET (UTC+1) in winter, but daylight saving time (CEST, UTC+2) ends last Sunday of October. October 12 is before that, so Madrid is on CEST = UTC+2.\n\nET on October 12, 2026: The US Eastern time daylight saving ends first Sunday of November, so on October 12, ET is EDT = UTC-4.\n\n12:00 AM ET = 00:00 EDT = UTC+4:00 \u2192 UTC time is 04:00 on October 12.\n\nMadrid time: UTC+2 \u2192 04:00 + 2 = 06:00 on October 12, 2026.\n\nANSWER: 2026-10-12 06:00"
